TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca, 1:1; heat 20C to 200C in 10 steps; allow calcite ppt/diss

SOLUTION 1 DIC solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50

SOLUTION 2 Ca solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -si Calcite
END
